  "Question": "Given \\(a\\parallel b\\), line \\(c\\) intersects \\(a\\) and \\(b\\). Angles \\(\\angle 1\\) and \\(\\angle 2\\) are same-side interior angles, with \\(\\angle 1=2x+20^\\circ\\) and \\(\\angle 2=3x-10^\\circ\\). Find the measure of \\(\\angle 1\\) in degrees.",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "88",
